                    <li>Black Pepper Essential Oil (Piper Nigrum): A natural circulatory stimulant. When applied topically, it increases local blood flow to warm up cold muscles, ease tension, and drive oxygen to dull skin cells</li>
                    <li>Vanilla Planifolia Extract: Rich in polyphenols, vanilla acts as a powerful antioxidant that helps soothe skin inflammation and reverse environmental damage while softening rough skin texture</li>
    </ul>
